    "body": "## Purpose\nEstablish an isolated, human-reviewed publication channel for daily ChatGPT REACH Scout discoveries. **Do not merge until you've reviewed the public data and workflow.**\n\n## Changes\n- Add 24-column Scout batch validator and SHA-256 manifest generator.\n- Add GitHub Actions validation on PRs (reject edits/deletions of prior batches) and automatic manifest refresh on pushes to main.\n- Add a public README describing Scout's PR-only publishing and human review safeguards.\n- Seed with **18 unreviewed Scout discovery candidates** from the October 21 follow-up batch, with Candidate IDs and PI email fields blank. No Smartsheet IDs, private reviewer decisions or credentials.\n\n## Safety\n- Does not modify PART-WPO/reach-dashboard or PART-WPO/SPARK.\n- Merge into GitHub means candidates are staged for Discovery Hub review only; **not approved or inserted into REACH**.\n- Daily Scout will open subsequent batch PRs but never merge them.\n\n## After merge\nCheck Actions workflow for green validation and open `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PART-WPO/reach-scout-discoveries/main/scout-discoveries/manifest.json`. Install the separately packaged Discovery Hub v1.24 feed module to point Apps Script to this new repository. Existing Hub human decisions remain unchanged.",
